WEBVTT

00:11:58.282 --> 00:12:02.123
♪ that you make me lose ♪
(bahwa kamu membuatku)

00:12:02.128 --> 00:12:05.849
♪ everything I know ♪
( kehilangan segalanya)

00:12:05.849 --> 00:12:09.364
♪ that I cannot choose ♪
(dan aku tidak bisa memutuskan)

00:12:09.377 --> 00:12:14.485
♪ to or not let go ♪
(untuk melepaskan atau tidak)